connections.description:
{connection_status}

Pause stops HomeCircle requests for this provider and remains in effect after a restart. Saved accounts, tracker identities, selections and history are kept. Existing reports may remain visible with their original report times. Other integrations control their own requests.

Resume deliberately allows requests again for this provider, including accounts paused after an access denial. Review provider terms, account access and diagnostics first. HomeCircle does not retry authentication to work around an access denial. Resuming does not reset Find My recovery safeguards.
